  "title": "RunCN #第19站｜北京凤凰岭夜跑：毕业图话，迟到了两年",
  "ready": false,
  "images": 53,
  "slug": "wuhan-graduation",
  "intro": "迟到两年的毕业图话，把爸妈、武大、东湖、毕业典礼和那段武汉时光收进同一篇回忆。",
  "map": "/assets/runcn-article-maps-20261022/wuhan-graduation.jpg",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-wuhan-graduation.jpg?v=20260628-beijing-abstract",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">又到一年毕业季，大家都在晒毕业照，回头一看，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">毕业快两年了</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">2019年似乎发生了很多，一直<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">遗憾</strong>没有把时间线补齐。逮到这几天有空，赶紧把照片贴推文里，得给自己和爸妈留点回忆，没事可以回来瞅瞅。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "2019武大毕业典礼 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "湖北武汉故事照片 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "爸妈来武汉看我毕业"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">2019年6月19日，爸妈和我坐的航<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">班一前一后到了武汉天河</strong>机场，因为和朋友去新疆自驾，结果竟成了爸妈接我。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "武大牌坊 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "湖北武汉故事照片 2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "武汉大学东湖凌波门栈道 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "湖北武汉故事照片 3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "武汉大学东湖凌波门栈道 by 路人",
      "alt": "武汉大学东湖凌波门栈道 by 路人"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">安顿好住宿之后带爸妈来武大看看牌坊，去东湖看看石头看看水，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">再在晚上去绿道骑骑车看看城门楼子</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "东湖骑车 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "湖北武汉故事照片 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "东湖骑车（楚城） @Arsenan",
      "alt": "湖北武汉故事照片 6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">隔了一天，武汉的雨下得很大，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">这场毕业典礼甚至还上了热搜</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "2019武大毕业典礼 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "湖北武汉故事照片 7"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "2019武大毕业典礼 by 坨坨",
      "alt": "2019武大毕业典礼 by 坨坨"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">小红旗，白雨衣，和六月武汉雨中弥漫的青草香，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">至今都记忆犹新</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Wuhan-Graduation-clean_files/img-009.webp",
